 ```text
 FinancialChartAppearance -> normalize -> resolved appearance
-                                      -> screen G2Spec
-                                      -> SVG/PNG G2Spec
+                                      -> family screen G2Spec
+                                      -> family SVG/PNG G2Spec
                                       -> accessible chart summary
 ```
 
